{
    "title": "\u062d\u0644\u0647\u0627 \u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0627\u0634\u064a - \u0627\u062e\u062a\u0628\u0631 \u062b\u0642\u0627\u0641\u062a\u0643",
    "description": "Solving it Alamshi is a game of challenge and speed in a variety of cultural questions in various fields.\r\nQuestions in Arab and international cultures await you to test yourself while running towards your goal (you cannot stop)!\r\n- More than 400 different questions.\r\nVarious departments and fields.\r\n- Many barriers and obstacles.\r\n- You can play with or without internet connection.\r\n- You can create your own quiz with select questions and answers and publish it for everyone to play!\r\n- You can play and rate tests made by other players in many areas.\r\n- Collect points and spend them in the relevant store to diversify ways to play and buy aids that help you solve questions.\r\n- You can play the infinite phase and challenge yourself to try to earn the highest number of points and challenge your friends.\r\n\r\nSolve it Almashi game is a dynamic cultural game that challenges the player to answer random questions in a short time, requiring speed of thinking and reaction.\r\nA game that requires intelligence, culture and intuitive speed!\r\nSolving it on the go will raise the ceiling of your cultural knowledge in addition to an enjoyable experience full of challenge and competition.\r\nDownload it now and solve it on the walk!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Solving it Alamshi is a game of challenge and speed in a variety of cultural questions in various fields.<br>Questions in Arab and international cultures await you to test yourself while running towards your goal (you cannot stop)!<br>- More than 400 different questions.<br>Various departments and fields.<br>- Many barriers and obstacles.<br>- You can play with or without internet connection.<br>- You can create your own quiz with select questions and answers and publish it for everyone to play!<br>- You can play and rate tests made by other players in many areas.<br>- Collect points and spend them in the relevant store to diversify ways to play and buy aids that help you solve questions.<br>- You can play the infinite phase and challenge yourself to try to earn the highest number of points and challenge your friends.<br><br>Solve it Almashi game is a dynamic cultural game that challenges the player to answer random questions in a short time, requiring speed of thinking and reaction.<br>A game that requires intelligence, culture and intuitive speed!<br>Solving it on the go will raise the ceiling of your cultural knowledge in addition to an enjoyable experience full of challenge and competition.<br>Download it now and solve it on the walk!",
    "summary": "Answer a variety of cultural questions and overcome barriers to reach the desired goal.",
